{"unit_id":"beijingwahw__dsh-memory-hub#card-zh","repo":"beijingwahw/dsh-memory-hub","commit":"fa12084d8db86974baa9cd1997dc9f3aa6b1a644","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-hub（DSH 插件，通用客户端）：为 DSH 提供跨会话的本地记忆。它注册 memory_store、memory_recall、memory_forget 和 memory_status 工具，并通过会话与工具事件自动捕获候选记忆。用户可以保存事实、偏好和决定，按关键词或问题召回旧记忆，查看记忆库状态并删除条目，也可从配置的文档或会话日志导入。记忆存于本机 JSONL 文件，默认目录为 ~/.dsh/memory-hub；不需要外部服务或 API 密钥，可选设置口令加密存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:35-46","src/index.ts:97-130","src/tools/memory-store.ts:42-90","src/tools/memory-recall.ts:16-77","src/tools/memory-forget.ts:21-56","src/tools/memory-status.ts:35-60"]}
